Mesnium Privacy Policy
Last updated: August 21, 2026

Mesnium is an AI automation and business systems company. This Privacy Policy explains how information may be handled when you interact with Mesnium services and integrations.

Information We May Process
Depending on the service or integration you use, Mesnium may process information such as account identifiers, contact information, messages, files, and other information that you or an authorized user provides.

How We Use Information
Information may be used to provide, operate, secure, maintain, and improve Mesnium services and to perform actions explicitly authorized by users.

Third-Party Services
Mesnium may connect with third-party platforms such as LinkedIn, Google, Meta, WhatsApp, Discord, and other services when a user explicitly authorizes such a connection. Those services have their own privacy policies and terms.

Data Security
We take reasonable measures to protect information processed through our services. No method of electronic storage or transmission is completely secure.

Data Retention
Information is retained only as reasonably necessary to provide the relevant service, meet operational requirements, or comply with applicable obligations.

Your Choices
You may request information about data associated with your use of Mesnium or request deletion where applicable, subject to legal and operational requirements.

Contact
For privacy-related questions or requests, contact Mesnium through its official communication channels.
